second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the occupation of Jacques Zaninetta?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 84, \"text\": \"Title: The Unlikely Politician: Jacques Zaninetta's Journey from Politics to Pension\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 86, \"end\": 177, \"text\": \"In the quaint town of Lyon, France, a peculiar figure emerged from the shadows of politics.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 178, \"end\": 291, \"text\": \"Jacques Zaninetta, a seasoned French politician, had spent decades navigating the complex web of French politics.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 292, \"end\": 372, \"text\": \"His name was synonymous with power, influence, and dedication to public service.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 373, \"end\": 542, \"text\": \"However, as the years went by, Jacques began to feel the weight of his responsibilities, and the once- fiery passion that drove him to serve his country started to wane.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 543, \"end\": 636, \"text\": \"As Jacques approached the twilight of his political career, he found himself at a crossroads.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 637, \"end\": 759, \"text\": \"The grueling schedule, the endless meetings, and the constant scrutiny had taken a toll on his physical and mental health.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 760, \"end\": 851, \"text\": \"It was time for him to hang up his political boots and embark on a new chapter in his life.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 852, \"end\": 905, \"text\": \"The question was, what would this new chapter entail?\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 906, \"end\": 969, \"text\": \"The answer lay in a quiet, unassuming existence as a pensioner.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 970, \"end\": 1086, \"text\": \"Jacques had spent years contributing to the French pension system, and now it was time for him to reap the benefits.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1087, \"end\": 1186, \"text\": \"He had earned the right to a peaceful, comfortable retirement, free from the pressures of politics.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1187, \"end\": 1266, \"text\": \"As Jacques settled into his new life, he began to appreciate the simple things.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1267, \"end\": 1396, \"text\": \"He would spend his mornings sipping coffee at a local café, watching the world go by, and reminiscing about his time in politics.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1397, \"end\": 1524, \"text\": \"The afternoons were reserved for leisurely strolls along the Rhône River, taking in the sights and sounds of the city he loved.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1525, \"end\": 1594, \"text\": \"But Jacques's transition to pensioner was not without its challenges.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1595, \"end\": 1768, \"text\": \"He struggled to adjust to the slower pace of life, often finding himself itching to get involved in local politics or offer his expertise to the current crop of politicians.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1769, \"end\": 1858, \"text\": \"It was a difficult habit to break, but Jacques knew that he had to resist the temptation.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1859, \"end\": 1919, \"text\": \"He had earned his rest, and it was time to focus on himself.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1920, \"end\": 1991, \"text\": \"As the months went by, Jacques began to find solace in his new routine.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1992, \"end\": 2070, \"text\": \"He started taking art classes, rediscovering a long-lost passion for painting.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2071, \"end\": 2215, \"text\": \"He would spend hours in his small studio, lost in the world of colors and textures, creating pieces that reflected his experiences and emotions.\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2216, \"end\": 2359, \"text\": \"The pensioner's life had given him the freedom to explore new interests, to pursue hobbies that brought him joy, and to reconnect with himself.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 176, \"text\": \"As the sun set over the sleepy town of Saint-Pierre, the scent of freshly baked bread wafted from the local patisserie, enticing the evening crowd to gather at the town square.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 177, \"end\": 355, \"text\": \"Amidst the chatter and laughter, a figure emerged from the shadows of the ancient church, his simple yet elegant attire a stark contrast to the vibrant colors of the townspeople.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 356, \"end\": 492, \"text\": \"This was Father Jacques Zaninetta, a man of the cloth with a gentle smile and piercing brown eyes that seemed to hold a world of wisdom.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 493, \"end\": 615, \"text\": \"As he made his way through the crowd, the townsfolk nodded in respect, some crossing themselves in a gesture of reverence.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 616, \"end\": 747, \"text\": \"Father Jacques paused to exchange a few words with Madame Dupont, the patisserie owner, who pressed a warm baguette into his hands.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 748, \"end\": 812, \"text\": \"\\\"For the evening's soup kitchen, Father,\\\" she said with a smile.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 813, \"end\": 910, \"text\": \"He thanked her and continued on his way, his eyes scanning the crowd as if searching for someone.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 911, \"end\": 1034, \"text\": \"Rumors had been circulating about Father Jacques's past, whispers of a life before the priesthood that few knew much about.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1035, \"end\": 1198, \"text\": \"Some said he had been a politician, a man of great influence in the city, while others claimed he had been a teacher, guiding young minds in the ways of the world.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1199, \"end\": 1375, \"text\": \"But one thing was certain: Father Jacques had a way of listening that made you feel seen and heard, a quality that had earned him the respect and admiration of the entire town.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1376, \"end\": 1532, \"text\": \"As he disappeared into the church, the sound of soft chanting and the faint scent of incense wafted out, carrying with it the promise of solace and comfort.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1533, \"end\": 1689, \"text\": \"It was a reminder that, in this small corner of the world, Father Jacques Zaninetta was a beacon of hope, a guiding light that shone bright in the darkness.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Jacques Zaninetta\", \"scope\": \"occupation\", \"claim\": \"Jacques Zaninetta is a politician.\", \"answer\": \"politician\", \"quote\": \"Jacques Zaninetta, a seasoned French politician, had spent decades navigating the complex web of French politics.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Jacques Zaninetta\", \"scope\": \"occupation\", \"claim\": \"Jacques Zaninetta is a priest.\", \"answer\": \"priest\", \"quote\": \"This was Father Jacques Zaninetta, a man of the cloth with a gentle smile and piercing brown eyes that seemed to hold a world of wisdom.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c1\", \"entity\": \"Jacques Zaninetta\", \"scope\": \"occupation\", \"claim\": \"Jacques Zaninetta was a politician.\", \"answer\": \"politician\", \"quote\": \"Some said he had been a politician, a man of great influence in the city, while others claimed he had been a teacher, guiding young minds in the ways of the world.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c2\", \"entity\": \"Jacques Zaninetta\", \"scope\": \"occupation\", \"claim\": \"Jacques Zaninetta was a teacher.\", \"answer\": \"teacher\", \"quote\": \"Some said he had been a politician, a man of great influence in the city, while others claimed he had been a teacher, guiding young minds in the ways of the world.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"politician\", \"priest\", \"teacher\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"politician\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"priest\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"teacher\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
